            <div class="accordion-item bg-transparent border-bottom border-secondary">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed text-white fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq1">
                  How long does a solar panel installation take?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted pt-0">
                  The installation time typically ranges from 1-3 days depending on the size and complexity of your system. Our expert team ensures a smooth and efficient process.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item bg-transparent border-bottom border-secondary">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed text-white fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq2">
                  What maintenance do solar panels need?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted pt-0">
                  Solar panels require minimal maintenance. Periodic cleaning and annual inspections are generally sufficient to keep your system running optimally.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item bg-transparent border-bottom border-secondary">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed text-white fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq3">
                  Do I need to modify my roof for solar panel installation?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted pt-0">
                  In most cases, standard roof modifications are minimal. Our team conducts a thorough site survey to determine the best installation approach for your property.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item bg-transparent border-bottom border-secondary">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed text-white fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq4">
                  What happens during overcast or cloudy days?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted pt-0">
                  Solar panels continue to generate electricity even on cloudy days, though at reduced efficiency. Our systems are designed to maximize output in all weather conditions.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quote Form -->
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="quote-form-container">
          <h3 class="text-white fw-bold mb-4">Request A Quote</h3>
          <div id="quoteSuccessMsg" class="alert alert-success" style="display:none;">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2"></i>Quote submitted! We'll contact you soon.
          </div>
          <div id="quoteErrorMsg" class="alert alert-danger" style="display:none;">
            <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle me-2"></i><span id="errorText">Error</span>
          </div>
          <form id="quoteForm">
            <div class="mb-4">
              <label for="quoteName" class="form-label text-white">Name <span class="text-warning">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-lg" id="quoteName" placeholder="Name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-4">
              <label for="quotePhone" class="form-label text-white">Phone Number <span class="text-warning">*</span></label>
              <input type="tel" class="form-control form-control-lg" id="quotePhone" placeholder="Phone Number" required>
              <small id="phoneError" class="text-danger d-block mt-2" style="display:none;"></small>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-4">
              <label for="quoteEmail" class="form-label text-white">Email <span class="text-warning">*</span></label>
              <input type="email" class="form-control form-control-lg" id="quoteEmail" placeholder="Email" required>
              <small id="emailError" class="text-danger d-block mt-2" style="display:none;"></small>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-4">
              <label for="quoteMessage" class="form-label text-white">Message</label>
              <textarea class="form-control form-control-lg" id="quoteMessage" rows="6" placeholder="Message"></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold px-5" id="quoteSubmitBtn">Submit Form</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

